than this!

1648
01:09:12,898 --> 01:09:14,150
QUIET CHEER

1649
01:09:14,233 --> 01:09:17,778
Here, you can comfortably
think of us as close friends

1650
01:09:18,362 --> 01:09:19,780
and stay with…

1651
01:09:19,864 --> 01:09:21,365
QUIET CHEER

1652
01:09:23,367 --> 01:09:24,201
This is nice.

1653
01:09:25,786 --> 01:09:27,288
Gosh, this is hard.

1654
01:09:28,080 --> 01:09:29,915
- You're staying for three days?
- Yes.

1655
01:09:29,999 --> 01:09:31,834
THEY'LL ALL STAY FOR THREE DAYS

1656
01:09:31,917 --> 01:09:34,170
So they're staying until the last day.

1657
01:09:34,253 --> 01:09:35,296
IN THAT CASE

