- Yes.

1661
01:09:44,013 --> 01:09:46,182
Goodbye, my beloved bed.

1662
01:09:46,265 --> 01:09:47,683
I'm leaving.

1663
01:09:47,766 --> 01:09:49,018
RAMYEON BOXES ARE EMPTIED

1664
01:09:49,101 --> 01:09:51,228
You can first decide where you'll stay.

1665
01:09:51,312 --> 01:09:53,022
The three of us
will use the <i>ramyeon</i> boxes.

1666
01:09:53,105 --> 01:09:54,940
THEY CHOOSE THE RAMYEON BOXES

1667
01:09:55,024 --> 01:09:56,066
We'll take the sofa.

1668
01:09:56,150 --> 01:09:57,484
THEY CHOOSE THE SOFA

1669
01:09:58,068 --> 01:09:59,236
What are your names?

1670
01:09:59,320 --> 01:10:00,988
- I'm Jang Seo-young.
- Seo-young.

1671
01:10:01,071 --> 01:10:03,449
- I'm Kim Han-na.
- Han-na.

1672
01:10:03,532 --> 01:10:04,408
What's your name?

1673
01:10:04,491 --> 01:10:05,701
I'm Lee Su-ryeon.

1674
01:10:05,784 --> 01:10:06,619
- Lee Su-ryeon?
- Yes.

1675
01:10:06,702 --> 01:10:07,745
I'm Lee Seong-bhin.

1676
01:10:07,828 --> 01:10:08,996
I'm Sim Hyeon-seo.

1677
01:10:09,079 --> 01:10:10,748
I'm Choo Yun-woo.

1678
01:10:10,831 --> 01:10:11,957
Can I call you Jun-ho?

1679
01:10:12,041 --> 01:10:13,292
Of course, as you please.

1680
