01:10:21,675 --> 01:10:23,844
You made your debut
a year before I was born.

1686
01:10:23,928 --> 01:10:25,221
Really?

1687
01:10:25,804 --> 01:10:26,889
Nice to meet you.

1688
01:10:27,765 --> 01:10:29,892
You can still call me by my name.

1689
01:10:29,975 --> 01:10:31,518
I'm fine with it.

1690
01:10:31,602 --> 01:10:32,686
I'll call you Jun-ho.

1691
