1693
01:10:36,649 --> 01:10:38,192
Gyeongnam Science High School.

1694
01:10:38,275 --> 01:10:39,777
- A science high school?
- Yes.

1695
01:10:41,403 --> 01:10:42,446
You guys are smart.

1696
