1738
01:12:16,290 --> 01:12:19,710
You look a bit like Ji Ye-eun.

1739
01:12:20,210 --> 01:12:21,337
"Control yourself."

1740
01:12:28,385 --> 01:12:29,720
"Control yourself."

1741
